# Sound View Window & Door

## Company
Sound View Window & Door

## Service Area
Greater Seattle Area. Never use "& Eastside".

## Experience
17+ years in the Pacific Northwest

## Core Offerings
Replacement windows, replacement doors, and custom glass. Consultative, low-pressure customer experience.

## Design Direction
Warm cream/ivory/beige backgrounds (#FAF8F5, #F3EFEA), deep navy text and accents (#1B2A4A, #0F172A), editorial typography, generous spacing.

## Copywriting Rules
Professional, grounded, consultative. Never use em dashes (—) anywhere in headings or copy.

## Code Standards
Next.js App Router (src/ directory), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS. Protect all private keys using server-side environment variables. Never touch or reference the live WordPress production site.
